1
00:00:00,583 --> 00:00:02,250
Pencil, watch this!

2
00:00:03,916 --> 00:00:06,250
Hah! Isn't that just so funny?

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:07,750
Absolutely not, Firey!

4
00:00:07,750 --> 00:00:12,541
I've seen Bubble pop quite a number of times,
but that right there was by far the cruelest.

5
00:00:12,541 --> 00:00:15,333
And you know, Firey? I think you
need a taste of your own medicine.

6
00:00:15,333 --> 00:00:16,041
Ahhh!

7
00:00:16,333 --> 00:00:18,541
Pencil! Don't tell me you just killed Firey!

8
00:00:18,666 --> 00:00:19,708
Out of my way!

9
00:00:22,541 --> 00:00:23,958
Pencil:
And I'm tired of you guys, too!

10
00:00:24,833 --> 00:00:26,625
- Huh?
- Ruh... ruh... rugle...

11
00:00:26,625 --> 00:00:27,500
- Augh!
- BWUH!

12
00:00:28,166 --> 00:00:29,333
Oh no!

13
00:00:29,583 --> 00:00:32,833
Hi, Pencil! Are you glad that I didn't vomit on you?

14
00:00:32,833 --> 00:00:37,875
Whoa! You can speak again?
Doesn't that feel weird after fifteen months of silence?

15
00:00:39,833 --> 00:00:40,250
Bleh!

16
00:00:40,958 --> 00:00:47,625
[INTRO PLAYS]

17
00:00:47,625 --> 00:00:48,625
Subtitles: TAFFYMARZI

18
00:00:50,416 --> 00:00:54,541
Spongy, Firey, and Pencil, you were up for elimination.

19
00:00:55,208 --> 00:00:58,291
We'll see who will be eliminated at the
Cake at Stake Ceremony.

20
00:01:09,958 --> 00:01:11,375
We have a cake this time.

21
00:01:11,958 --> 00:01:13,416
It's a collection of shovels.

22
00:01:13,416 --> 00:01:16,333
Excuse me, but how are shovels cakes?

23
00:01:16,333 --> 00:01:18,875
Well, they're caked with mud, so they're cakes.

24
00:01:19,458 --> 00:01:21,291
If you're safe, you'll get a cake.

25
00:01:21,750 --> 00:01:24,708
One person won't receive a cake and will be eliminated.

26
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:30,750
Announcer:
Ice Cube, Rocky, David, Bubble, and Leafy
were not up for elimination, so they all get cakes.

27
00:01:34,083 --> 00:01:35,500
Are you rejecting my cakes?

28
00:01:36,083 --> 00:01:39,458
That makes me want to cry, and I cry acid.

29
00:01:39,666 --> 00:01:40,625
Wah, wah, wah!

30
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:42,875
- Ahhhh!
- Hmph!
- Aw, seriously?!

31
00:01:43,041 --> 00:01:49,500
Anyways, 464 people voted for either Spongy, Firey,
or Pencil to be eliminated.

32
00:01:50,125 --> 00:01:54,708
Announcer:
Firey, you only got 64 votes, so you're safe. Fling!

33
00:01:54,875 --> 00:01:55,541
Catch!

34
00:01:55,791 --> 00:01:57,375
See, I like your cake!

35
00:01:57,541 --> 00:01:58,500
Hulal-lal-luh!

36
00:01:58,625 --> 00:01:59,208
Announcer:
Pencil,

37
00:01:59,750 --> 00:02:04,166
in episode 15, you were the
only contestant who never got a vote.

38
00:02:04,166 --> 00:02:05,041
I remember that.

39
00:02:05,041 --> 00:02:10,791
For this episode, you received 259 votes,
which is the most ever, you are eliminated.

40
00:02:10,958 --> 00:02:11,541
What?!

41
00:02:11,541 --> 00:02:13,625
This machine thingy must be broken!

42
00:02:17,375 --> 00:02:19,750
Oh well, Pencil was such a menace anyway.

43
00:02:19,916 --> 00:02:24,708
Oh no! Ice Cube, with Pencil gone,
our alliance is too small. What do we do?

44
00:02:24,916 --> 00:02:26,458
Needy's got to join!

45
00:02:27,166 --> 00:02:28,791
People, quiet down.

46
00:02:29,416 --> 00:02:30,750
You are now the final 7.

47
00:02:31,416 --> 00:02:33,916
That's so few, I can count it on one hand.

48
00:02:34,166 --> 00:02:35,500
Jeez, no need to brag!

49
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:39,000
Anyway, since you have made it so far,
you all get a reward.

50
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,916
- David: Seriously?
- Everyone else: Yeah?

51
00:02:40,041 --> 00:02:44,250
Teddy bears! Every point you currently
have is traded for one teddy bear...

52
00:02:44,250 --> 00:02:49,500
[Everyone praises]

53
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:52,750
...but reaching the final 7 also means a
new stage in the battle.

54
00:02:52,750 --> 00:02:53,541
Everyone:
Gasp!

55
00:02:53,666 --> 00:02:55,125
That means no more points.

56
00:02:57,458 --> 00:03:00,166
The 19th contest is a unicycle race.

57
00:03:00,666 --> 00:03:03,833
Announcer:
The first three people to finish the course
will receive immunity.

58
00:03:04,375 --> 00:03:06,208
The rest will be up for elimination.

59
00:03:06,916 --> 00:03:07,583
- Go.
- Gah!

60
00:03:07,583 --> 00:03:09,125
- Firey: Woah! Oh no, I can't balance!
- David: Aw, seriously?!
- Bubble: Woah, oh no! Oooh!

61
00:03:09,125 --> 00:03:09,708
Ahhh!

62
00:03:10,125 --> 00:03:12,500
I think I'm getting... the hang of it.

63
00:03:12,958 --> 00:03:14,166
Come on, Ice Cube, you're coming with me.

64
00:03:14,166 --> 00:03:15,791
I don't want you being friends with
that backstabbing Bubble.

65
00:03:16,666 --> 00:03:18,791
Okay, I do not backstab!

66
00:03:18,916 --> 00:03:21,750
Seriously, do you really think that bubbles can stab?

67
00:03:21,750 --> 00:03:23,666
- Ice Cube: Ahhh!
- Leafy: Ah! Get away, get away! Before Bubble stabs us!

68
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:30,375
Leafy and Ice Cube:
Ahhhhh!

69
00:03:30,541 --> 00:03:32,250
Um, the right way is that way...

70
00:03:33,291 --> 00:03:36,625
Huh... Heheh-haoh... Uh...

71
00:03:36,625 --> 00:03:39,958
Woah-oh! Ha-haohh! Wheee!

72
00:03:39,958 --> 00:03:43,083
Ohhhh! Hah! Ah-ha, ha, haoh!!

73
00:03:43,083 --> 00:03:43,833
Huh?

74
00:03:43,833 --> 00:03:44,708
Ha-AHH!

75
00:03:44,708 --> 00:03:48,416
No brakes, no brakes, no brakes! Ahh... ahhh..

76
00:03:48,416 --> 00:03:49,958
Uhhh-hah-uhhh...

77
00:03:49,958 --> 00:03:51,541
Huh-uhh... Oh.

78
00:03:51,666 --> 00:03:52,166
Phew...

79
00:03:52,541 --> 00:03:55,375
Th-th-that was close...way too close.

80
00:03:55,708 --> 00:03:58,958
Ahhhhh!

81
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:01,083
Ha, ha. What a failure!

82
00:04:01,416 --> 00:04:05,708
Oioh, oh, ohh-ho-ho! Haaah, oh, oh.

83
00:04:05,708 --> 00:04:08,333
Bubble, you finished first, so you get immunity.

84
00:04:08,333 --> 00:04:09,125
Yoylecake!

85
00:04:10,250 --> 00:04:10,625
Bleh!

86
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:16,125
Rocky is also immune.
Now there is only one spot left for immunity.

87
00:04:16,208 --> 00:04:18,875
Huh? One spot left? I'd better hurry up!

88
00:04:19,041 --> 00:04:20,708
Aw, seriously?!

89
00:04:20,708 --> 00:04:23,666
[slo-mo]
Aw, seriously?!

90
00:04:23,916 --> 00:04:27,416
[in the tune of "Mary Had a Little Lamb"]
♪ Ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh-ahh-ahh! ♪

91
00:04:27,875 --> 00:04:29,375
♪ Ahh-ahh-ahh! ♪

92
00:04:29,833 --> 00:04:31,416
♪ Ahh-ahh-ahh! ♪

93
00:04:31,833 --> 00:04:35,791
♪ Ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh, ahh-ahh-ahh-ahh! ♪

94
00:04:35,791 --> 00:04:38,333
♪ Ahh, ahh, ahh-ahh-ahh! ♪

95
00:04:38,916 --> 00:04:40,166
Hup! Hup! Hup!

96
00:04:41,916 --> 00:04:44,333
Hnnngehhh-Hyuh!

97
00:04:44,541 --> 00:04:46,041
Yay! I get immunity!

98
00:04:46,083 --> 00:04:47,958
Yes, Firey. You do.

99
00:04:48,833 --> 00:04:50,666
Would you like to see a magic trick?

100
00:04:50,666 --> 00:04:53,583
Don't think I don't know what your
magic tricks are like. NO!

101
00:04:53,583 --> 00:04:55,666
Well, too bad. Poof.

102
00:04:55,666 --> 00:04:58,333
Oh, wait, that's not what I meant to do. Poof.

103
00:04:58,833 --> 00:05:02,375
So you three have immunity, while you four don't.
Is that correct?

104
00:05:02,375 --> 00:05:05,333
- Firey: Yeah, yeah! That's right, that's right!
- Bubble: You're correct! That is correct!
- Rocky: BLEH! BLEH! BLEH!

105
00:05:05,333 --> 00:05:07,625
- Leafy: Y-yeah, y-you could believe that.
- Ice Cube: Ahhh!
- David: Aw, seriously?!
- Spongy: [mumbling]

106
00:05:07,625 --> 00:05:08,916
- Leafy: You know, i-if you wanted to.
- Ice Cube: Ahhh!
- David: Aw, seriously?!
- Spongy: [mumbling]

107
00:05:08,916 --> 00:05:10,500
- Leafy: Because... ohh... it's true...
- Ice Cube: Ahhh!
- David: Aw, seriously?!
- Spongy: [mumbling]

108
00:05:10,666 --> 00:05:13,833
Bubble, since you finished first, you get another reward.

109
00:05:14,125 --> 00:05:16,750
You get to choose a fourth person to have immunity.

110
00:05:16,916 --> 00:05:19,583
Ohhh, o-okay. Uhhhh, Ice Cube,

111
00:05:19,833 --> 00:05:21,416
- are we still in an alliance?
- NO!

112
00:05:21,416 --> 00:05:26,166
Uhhh, then I'll give to Leafy
to prove to her that I'm a nice person after all.

113
00:05:26,291 --> 00:05:28,916
Well, I guess that's somewhat nice but not extremely nice.

114
00:05:28,916 --> 00:05:31,000
You've still got a lot of work to do
but at least it was a good effort.

115
00:05:31,375 --> 00:05:32,500
Blah, blah, whatever.

116
00:05:32,833 --> 00:05:36,791
So that leaves David, Spongy and
Ice Cube up for elimination.

117
00:05:37,291 --> 00:05:41,833
Voters and viewers, subscribers and commenters,
trolls and flamers.

118
00:05:41,833 --> 00:05:45,500
Vote off who you think should be eliminated
by commenting on this video.

119
00:05:46,125 --> 00:05:48,416
Every vote counts, so please do vote.

120
00:05:49,583 --> 00:05:55,166
Oh yeah, do not forget to watch Episode 20
which comes out on August 1st, 2011.